<section>
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item>
      <h2>The bridge from result to cause</h2>
      <p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p>
      <h3>Revenue bridge · $M</h3>
      <grid divider="sm neutral-border" vertical-sizing="hug">
        <grid-item colspan="10" background-color="surface" padding="12pt 8pt">
          <h4>$23.4</h4><p font-size="sm">Prior quarter</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="8" padding="12pt 8pt">
          <h4><span text-color="palette-2">+$1.0</span></h4><p font-size="sm">New business</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="8" padding="12pt 8pt">
          <h4><span text-color="palette-2">+$0.7</span></h4><p font-size="sm">Expansion</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="8" padding="12pt 8pt">
          <h4><span text-color="palette-2">+$0.3</span></h4><p font-size="sm">Price &amp; mix</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="8" padding="12pt 8pt">
          <h4><span text-color="accent">−$0.5</span></h4><p font-size="sm">Churn</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="8" padding="12pt 8pt">
          <h4><span text-color="accent">−$0.1</span></h4><p font-size="sm">Currency</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="10" background-color="palette-2" padding="12pt 8pt">
          <h4>$24.8</h4><p font-size="sm">Current quarter</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
      <h3>Gross-margin bridge · percentage points</h3>
      <grid divider="sm neutral-border" vertical-sizing="hug">
        <grid-item colspan="10" background-color="surface" padding="12pt 8pt">
          <h4>59%</h4><p font-size="sm">Prior quarter</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="10" padding="12pt 8pt">
          <h4><span text-color="palette-2">+1.0</span></h4><p font-size="sm">Mix</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="10" padding="12pt 8pt">
          <h4><span text-color="palette-2">+0.8</span></h4><p font-size="sm">Infrastructure</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="10" padding="12pt 8pt">
          <h4><span text-color="palette-2">+0.5</span></h4><p font-size="sm">Delivery</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="10" background-color="accent" padding="12pt 8pt">
          <h4>−0.3</h4><p font-size="sm">Discounting</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="10" background-color="palette-2" padding="12pt 8pt">
          <h4>61%</h4><p font-size="sm">Current quarter</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
      <p><b>The bridges reconcile:</b> growth came primarily from new business, while discounting remained the visible margin leak.</p>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>